msgid ""
"快速开始\n"
"---------------------------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Quick Start\n"
"---------------------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"本文面向 Ascend NPU 环境，提供基于 GSM8K 和 Qwen3-0.6B 的最小化 GRPO 训练验证流程，涵盖四种训推后端组合，帮助用户快速上手。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"This article provides a minimal GRPO training and validation process based on GSM8K and Qwen3-0.6B for the Ascend NPU environment. It covers four training and inference backend combinations to help you get started quickly.\n"
""

msgid ""
"验证范围：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Verification scope:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- 环境入口：verl 入口是否可用；\n"
"- 数据读取：GSM8K数据集是否正确解析；\n"
"- 组件初始化：actor、rollout、reference worker 是否能初始化；\n"
"- 模型推理：vLLM-Ascend/sglang rollout 是否能生成；\n"
"- 端到端链路：训练流程是否能完成首个 step。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- Environment entry: whether the verl entry is available.\n"
"- Data reading: whether the GSM8K dataset is parsed correctly.\n"
"- Component initialization: whether the actor, rollout, and reference worker can be initialized.\n"
"- Model inference: whether the vLLM-Ascend/sglang rollout can generate.\n"
"- End-to-end pipeline: whether the training process can complete the first step.\n"
""

msgid ""
"配置提示：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Configuration tips:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- 默认配置：示例脚本均使用 Qwen3-0.6B 模型和 GSM8K 数据集。\n"
"- 硬件适配：由于 A3 每卡含 2 Die，运行示例需将 ``n_gpus_per_node`` 参数设置为16（A2 每卡含 1 die）\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- Default configuration: The sample scripts use the Qwen3-0.6B model and the GSM8K dataset.\n"
"- Hardware adaptation: Because each A3 card contains 2 dies, set the ``n_gpus_per_node`` parameter to 16 to run the samples (each A2 card contains 1 die).\n"
""

msgid ""
"环境准备\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Environment Preparation\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"运行本文脚本前，请确认已完成 verl Ascend 环境安装。环境安装详见 `昇腾安装指南 <./install_guidance.rst>`_ 。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Before running the scripts in this guide, ensure that you have installed the verl Ascend environment. For environment installation, refer to the `Ascend Installation Guide <./install_guidance.rst>`_ .\n"
""

msgid ""
"权重准备\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Preparing weights\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. 请自行从Hugging Face上下载 Qwen3-0.6B 模型权重。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. Download the Qwen3-0.6B model weights from Hugging Face.\n"
""

msgid ""
"2. 脚本中的默认读取权重路径为 ``~/models/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B``，建议将权重放在该路径下。若路径不同请修改脚本中的MODEL_PATH指向本地路径。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"2. The default path for weights in the script is ``~/models/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B``. We recommend placing the weights in this path. If your path is different, modify MODEL_PATH in the script to point to the local path.\n"
""

msgid ""
"数据准备\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Data preparation\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. 请自行从Hugging Face上下载 GSM8K 原始数据集。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. Download the original GSM8K dataset from Hugging Face yourself.\n"
""

msgid ""
"2. 执行以下命令（请根据实际数据集路径调整命令）\n"
""
msgstr ""
"2. Run the following command (adjust the command based on your actual dataset path)\n"
""

msgid ""
"   生成如下文件：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   Generate the following files:\n"
""

msgid ""
"运行方式\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"How to run\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. 进入项目目录： ``cd /your/path/verl``。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. Go to the project directory: ``cd /your/path/verl``.\n"
""

msgid ""
"2. 使能CANN环境：执行以下命令。（若您自定义了 CANN 的路径，请根据实际路径调整命令。）\n"
""
msgstr ""
"2. Enable the CANN environment: Run the following commands. (If you have customized the CANN path, adjust the commands based on the actual path.)\n"
""

msgid ""
"3. 运行脚本：当前提供四种常用训推后端组合，请参考以下表格选择对应脚本：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"3. Run the script: Four common training and inference backend combinations are currently provided. Refer to the following table to select the corresponding script:\n"
""

msgid ""
"   * - 组合\n"
"     - 训练后端\n"
"     - rollout 后端\n"
"     - 运行方式\n"
"   * - vLLM + FSDP2\n"
"     - FSDP2\n"
"     - vLLM-Ascend\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_fsdp2_vllm_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - vLLM + Megatron\n"
"     - Megatron\n"
"     - vLLM-Ascend\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_megatron_vllm_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - SGLang + FSDP2\n"
"     - FSDP2\n"
"     - SGLang\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_fsdp2_sglang_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - SGLang + Megatron\n"
"     - Megatron\n"
"     - SGLang\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_megatron_sglang_ascend.sh\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   * - Combination\n"
"     - Training backend\n"
"     - Rollout backend\n"
"     - Execution method\n"
"   * - vLLM + FSDP2\n"
"     - FSDP2\n"
"     - vLLM-Ascend\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_fsdp2_vllm_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - vLLM + Megatron\n"
"     - Megatron\n"
"     - vLLM-Ascend\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_megatron_vllm_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - SGLang + FSDP2\n"
"     - FSDP2\n"
"     - SGLang\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_fsdp2_sglang_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - SGLang + Megatron\n"
"     - Megatron\n"
"     - SGLang\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_megatron_sglang_ascend.sh\n"
""

msgid ""
"脚本内具体参数说明详见 `训练配置参数与指标说明 <../dev_guide/model_dev/parameter_and_metrics.md>`_。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"For details about the parameters in the script, refer to `Training Configuration Parameters and Metrics Description <../dev_guide/model_dev/parameter_and_metrics.md>`_.\n"
""

msgid ""
"多节点任务拉起详见 `多机任务拉起操作指南 <../model_support/examples/multi-machine_task_startup_practice.rst>`_。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"For details on launching multi-node tasks, see `Multi-Machine Task Startup Practice Guide <../model_support/examples/multi-machine_task_startup_practice.rst>`_.\n"
""

